<item>
  <title>Sara Zago talks about aperiodic EEG at the SIPF congress</title>
  <dc:creator>News </dc:creator>
  <link>https://sancamilloirccs-ondalab.github.io/posts/news-title/2026-zago-sipf.html</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 




<section id="summary" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="summary">Summary</h2>
<p>On 18 September 2026, Sara Zago gave the talk <em>Aperiodic EEG Across Aging and Neurological Disorders: A Clinical Perspective</em> at the congress of the SIPF (Società Italiana di Psicofisiologia e Neuroscienze) in Noto, dedicated to the aging brain.</p>
<p>The talk was part of the symposium <em>The Aperiodic Component of EEG: Promise, Pitfalls, and Perspectives in Aging and Neuropathology</em>.</p>
